{"1870180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frozen Friday Night: The Eve", "steam_appid": 1870180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Frozen Journey Roadmap and Q&amp;A</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good evening, survivors. This is the FFN Team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to share the roadmap for our planned updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small enjoyable pastime for healing after terrifying experiences (also offers XP)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New snacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 4</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fixes and frame optimization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 5</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New pizzas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 7</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 8</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journal UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 10</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable Pandu as a playable character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 11</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New evil faction (Human type)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 12</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stores and merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 13</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extension of the new evil faction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 14</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New raid boss (Human type)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 15</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 16</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New killer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 17</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furniture store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 18</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New raid boss (Creature type)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 19</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New killer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 20</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New creature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 21</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New state and new city accessible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 22</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New killers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 23</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New raid boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 24</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Apparel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that features may be modified, omitted, or new ones added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q&amp;A</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When will Flaming Friday Night be re-released?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly sometime between the 20th and 21st updates of Frozen Friday Night: The Eve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why didn't you guys consider Early Access?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually, we considered it. Steamworks requested a draft revision, but we aimed to release Frozen Friday Night: The Eve on Christmas Eve and didn't have enough time for revisions. Therefore, we released FFN EVE without Early Access and continue to add planned content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We always appreciate your interest and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FFN Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, hey. It's you! Have a seat and grab some pizza. Champagne? I'm good, thank you. Except I messed up the History of Art, you know, like Baroque, Rococo, Bauhaus, Cubism... yeah, they really make me wanna puke. So, how have you been? We've barely talked in a year. I thought you were so quiet at first. Oh, I almost forgot your name, haha. Sorry. Oh, really? Same! I'm Jimmy. Cheers, really nice to see you again, friend. Let's get wasted tonight then! By the way, do you like scary movies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a Friday night, deep in the Christmas season, Setsuka throws a festive party and invites her friends to join in the merriment. As the night progresses, and the drinks flow, an unexpected blackout shrouds the gathering in darkness. That's when Rose and Pandu search for their friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FFN Eve, the prequel to Flaming Friday Night, is a Horror Noir Action RPG. The Santa Mask Suit and the Whispering Sunrise Forest await Rose and Pandu. Merry Christmas, and happy insane journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can play as the tough and cool Rose. (Pandu will be available as a playable character in a future update.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors will meet all kinds of people: good, bad, or weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors will enjoy great dinner options that offer various buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can enjoy a variety of small experiences. (More will be added.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Various weapons are waiting for survivors. Be their best friends. (More will be added.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can fortify yourselves in various ways: leveling up, perks, super protein, reading, discovering four-leaf clovers, and more. These help you against the scary enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The night is still being updated. Until their journey ends, Rose and Pandu will encounter new enemies and step into new stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror game contains extremely brutal and violent content, including blood, murder, and dismemberment elements. Streamers should set their live streaming settings to allow only adults to watch while you're playing this game. The infirm, pregnant women, and children must not play this game. Additionally, this videogame may cause people with photosensitive epilepsy to convulse in seizures. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of this videogame is purely fictional, is not intended to represent or depict any actual event, person, or entity, and any such similarities are purely coincidental. The makers and publishers of this game do not in any way endorse, condone or encourage engaging in any conduct depicted in this videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters in this videogame do not represent any country, race, organization, gender, generation, and so on. Each of them is a unique individual.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, hey. It's you! Have a seat and grab some pizza. Champagne? I'm good, thank you. Except I messed up the History of Art, you know, like Baroque, Rococo, Bauhaus, Cubism... yeah, they really make me wanna puke. So, how have you been? We've barely talked in a year. I thought you were so quiet at first. Oh, I almost forgot your name, haha. Sorry. Oh, really? Same! I'm Jimmy. Cheers, really nice to see you again, friend. Let's get wasted tonight then! By the way, do you like scary movies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a Friday night, deep in the Christmas season, Setsuka throws a festive party and invites her friends to join in the merriment. As the night progresses, and the drinks flow, an unexpected blackout shrouds the gathering in darkness. That's when Rose and Pandu search for their friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FFN Eve, the prequel to Flaming Friday Night, is a Horror Noir Action RPG. The Santa Mask Suit and the Whispering Sunrise Forest await Rose and Pandu. Merry Christmas, and happy insane journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can play as the tough and cool Rose. (Pandu will be available as a playable character in a future update.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors will meet all kinds of people: good, bad, or weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors will enjoy great dinner options that offer various buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can enjoy a variety of small experiences. (More will be added.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Various weapons are waiting for survivors. Be their best friends. (More will be added.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survivors can fortify yourselves in various ways: leveling up, perks, super protein, reading, discovering four-leaf clovers, and more. These help you against the scary enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The night is still being updated. Until their journey ends, Rose and Pandu will encounter new enemies and step into new stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror game contains extremely brutal and violent content, including blood, murder, and dismemberment elements. Streamers should set their live streaming settings to allow only adults to watch while you're playing this game. The infirm, pregnant women, and children must not play this game. Additionally, this videogame may cause people with photosensitive epilepsy to convulse in seizures. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of this videogame is purely fictional, is not intended to represent or depict any actual event, person, or entity, and any such similarities are purely coincidental. The makers and publishers of this game do not in any way endorse, condone or encourage engaging in any conduct depicted in this videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters in this videogame do not represent any country, race, organization, gender, generation, and so on. Each of them is a unique individual.</p>", "short_description": "FFN Eve, the prequel to Flaming Friday Night, is a Horror Noir Action RPG. The Santa Mask Suit and the Whispering Sunrise Forest await Rose and Pandu. Merry Christmas, and happy insane journey.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "reviews": "“This game is so unhinged, obscene and fun. With a variety of things to do, horror atmosphere and a variety of weapons and items to choose from - I love the gory death scenes.”<br>9/10 – Ataraxia Reviews<br><br>“Frozen Friday Night: The Eve offers you a brutal game which has all the elements of a horror game.”<br>Adult World Gamers<br><br>“This witty and touching scary game captures the spirit of scary-movie rules, blending well-timed humour and drama with action-RPG elements.”<br>Horrorstagram<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1870180/header.jpg?t=1786882475", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1870180/7133b5f147ba0cf25089f5bad2162e8dbcbaa0f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786882475", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1870180/7133b5f147ba0cf25089f5bad2162e8dbcbaa0f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786882475", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core (Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-2450M)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core (Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-2450M)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright 2022. HiderumStudios. all rights reserved.", "developers": ["HiderumStudios"], "publishers": ["HiderumStudios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 299, "discount_percent":